OL,3,AFlight recorders recovered from
OL,4,A'devastating' Amazon cargo plane crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FInvestigators have recovered the flight
OL,7,Frecorders from the Amazon cargo plane
OL,8,Fthat crashed at Miami International
OL,9,FAirport, but the priority remains the
OL,10,Frecovery of victims, the National
OL,11,FTransportation Safety Board (NTSB) has
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FFive people were killed and five others
OL,15,Fseriously injured when the Boeing
OL,16,F767-300, operated by 21 Air, overshot
OL,17,Fthe runway shortly before 14:00 local
OL,18,Ftime (19:00 BST) on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
