OL,3,AFlight recorders recovered from
OL,4,A'devastating' Amazon cargo plane crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plane hit two vehicles, including a
OL,7,Fwhite van carrying seven people within
OL,8,Fthe airport perimeter, and a Toyota
OL,9,Fwith three passengers.
OL,11,FNTSB chairwoman Jennifer Homendy said
OL,12,Fit was too early to draw conclusions
OL,13,Fabout what caused the crash, with
OL,14,Finvestigators still in the "fact
OL,15,Ffinding stage".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
